      ],
      "source": "https://chatthillsga.us/history/index.php",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2014, the city annexed 5,473 acres northward, adding the historic county seat of Campbellton to its boundaries.",
